# Soft Glass card (LOCKED)

When creating or restyling a Personal / Utang **card**, use the Soft Glass Enterprise lock from Quick Actions.

Lock file: `src/Products/PinoyBusinessPOS/ExItS.PinoyBusinessPOS.React/src/features/ui-standards/soft-glass-card-global-default.ts`

Reference CSS: `.personal-qa-glass--start|lent|owe|stores|people` in `globals.css` (light + `[data-theme="dark"]`).

Component: `SoftGlassQuickAction` for Soft Glass quick-action rows.

## Recipe

- Pastel / transparent gradient wash (not flat solid fill)
- Shell radius: `SOFT_GLASS_RADIUS` = **1.1rem** (`--soft-glass-radius`; same as `TABLE_GLOBAL_SOFT_GLASS_RADIUS`)
- 1px border: slate mixed with accent soft (`SOFT_GLASS_BORDER_SLATE` / `SOFT_GLASS_BORDER_SLATE_PCT`)
- Inset top highlight + soft elevation (~`SOFT_GLASS_SHADOW_ACCENT_PCT`% accent)
- Label: `SOFT_GLASS_LABEL_SIZE` / `SOFT_GLASS_LABEL_WEIGHT` (14px / 600), accent ink in light; `#e2e8f0` in dark
- Hover / active: color-only, `SOFT_GLASS_TRANSITION_MS` (120ms) — **no** lift, scale, or translate
- Focus: `SOFT_GLASS_FOCUS` (`#8b5cf6`) outline
- Filled icon / pennant chips with soft radial highlight (not neon glow)

## Title ribbon (LOCKED — Soft Glass default)

Command: `ext soft-glass ribbon radius` (`SOFT_GLASS_RIBBON_DEFAULT_COMMAND`).

- Radius: `SOFT_GLASS_RIBBON_RADIUS` = **`1.1rem 1.1rem 1.1rem 0`** (`--soft-glass-ribbon-radius`)
- Same Soft Glass shell radius on the three free corners; fold corner (bottom-start) stays **0** for the ribbon notch
- Use on Soft Glass ribbon cards: Money / detail / People / invitations / workplaces Soft Glass shells and any new Soft Glass `utang-ribbon-card` / `person-ribbon-card`
- Selector family: Soft Glass shell `.personal-tracker-card__ribbon` (see `globals.css` Soft Glass ribbon radius lock)
- Do **not** use the legacy sharp `0.2rem` ribbon radius on Soft Glass cards

## Soft Glass input / dropdown radius (LOCKED)

Command: `ext soft-glass field radius` (`SOFT_GLASS_FIELD_DEFAULT_COMMAND`).

- Radius: `SOFT_GLASS_FIELD_RADIUS` = **`0.6875rem`** (`--soft-glass-field-radius`)
- Same as global Soft control shape (`--exits-radius-soft`) — **not** the Soft Glass shell `1.1rem`
- Use on Soft Glass inputs, selects, dropdown menus, Soft Glass modal field chrome (e.g. Update Balance), and Soft Glass fact cards that wrap field-like content
- Keep the outlined border; Soft Glass wash may sit behind it
- Do **not** force shell `1.1rem` on Soft Glass fields unless the user asks

## Quick Action trailing (LOCKED)

Command: `ext soft-glass qa trailing-auto` (`SOFT_GLASS_QA_DEFAULT_COMMAND`).

| Trailing | When | Mark |
| --- | --- | --- |
| `count` | A count is present (including `0`) | Soft Glass circular badge (`.personal-qa-glass__badge`) |
| `chevron` | Navigate / open, no count | Caret (`.personal-qa-glass__chevron`) |
| `add` | Create / open-add | Plain `+` (`.personal-qa-glass__plus--*`) |

Use `softGlassQaTrailing({ count, trailing })`. Do not invent a different end mark.

## Identities

Use `SOFT_GLASS_LIGHT` / `SOFT_GLASS_DARK`:

| Job | Identity |
| --- | --- |
| I lent / success | `lent` (green) |
| I owe / info money | `owe` (blue) — **not** warn orange |
| Stores / purple | `stores` |
| Add person | `people` (royal blue) |
| Start / cyan | `start` |
| Info panel / detail QA | `info` |

Every identity (including **`info`**) uses the same Soft Glass QA shell recipe in light and dark. Do not leave `info` on the legacy light grey border.

## Dark Quick Action border (LOCKED — home Quick Actions)

Default dark border matches Personal home Soft Glass Quick Actions:

- Rest: `1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--personal-qa-chip) SOFT_GLASS_DARK_BORDER_CHIP_PCT%, SOFT_GLASS_DARK_BORDER_SLATE)` → **16%** chip into **`#475569`**
- Hover: **22%** chip into **`#64748b`** (`SOFT_GLASS_DARK_BORDER_HOVER_*`)
- Do **not** use light-mode slate mixes (`#e2e8f0` / `#cbd5e1`) on dark Soft Glass QA — they look washed out

## Forbidden

- `backdrop-filter` / `blur()`
- Neon glow, purple-on-white AI defaults
- Flat Material shadow stacks as the only surface
- Warn / brown for owe cards
- Hard primary-blue outline rings that ignore Soft Glass identity borders

Change this lock only when the user asks. Update `soft-glass-card-global-default.ts`, `soft-glass-card-global-default.test.ts`, `SoftGlassQuickAction.tsx`, Soft Glass QA / ribbon / field CSS (`--soft-glass-radius`, `--soft-glass-ribbon-radius`, `--soft-glass-field-radius`, dark QA border tokens), and the `/ui-standards` Soft Glass quick action sample together.
